    "SELF-AUTHORED SYNTHETIC FIXTURE. Not a recording of a real HubSpot account.",
    "Envelope shape follows HubSpot's public documentation for GET /crm/v3/objects/contacts:",
    "a results array of {id, properties, createdAt, updatedAt, archived}, and an optional",
    "paging.next.{after,link} that is OMITTED on the final page.",
    "Every person, company, and domain here is invented and uses the reserved .example TLD.",
    "This cassette is written for a client built with page_size=2, so the exchanges match on",
    "limit=2. A client using a different page size will miss the cassette, loudly, by design.",
    "Exchange 2 scripts a 429 for the SAME page as exchange 3, so the backoff path is",
    "exercised in order: refused with a Retry-After, then served on the retry.",
    "Contact 704 deliberately has no email address. It is the poison record: the engine's",
    "existing validation boundary dead-letters it rather than writing a contact with no key."
